window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Ben said he loved me, lusted after me, and wanted to spend the rest of his life with me. From the very beginning, I was honest with him about my complicated life. He promised me the only thing that mattered was our love. I thought the future was set until...</p> <p>\"Evie, I can't do us anymore.\" </p> <p>The day Ben walked away was the day my love life went on permanent hiatus. Men were a distraction that I didn't want or need until...</p> <p>Tall, dark, and handsome ex-pro-football player Butler Thompson entered the picture and interrupted my heart.</p>"; 
